  "body": "* 188sqm land size / 102sqm indoor living space\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n* 2 luxury bathrooms with premium finishes\r\n* Stylish LED mirrors with sensor lighting\r\n* Timeless design with enduring appeal\r\n* Skylight in the kitchen providing abundant natural light\r\n*  Open-plan living and dining area\r\n* Quality construction and superior craftsmanship\r\n* Elegant finishes throughout\r\n* Spacious and functional layout\r\n* Low-maintenance modern living\r\n\r\nBlending classic architecture with timeless appeal, this beautifully designed home sits on a generous 188sqm section with a 102sqm thoughtfully laid-out indoor area, delivering an elegant, stylish living environment that never goes out of fashion. Meticulously built with premium finishes and exquisite attention to detail, the property strikes a perfect balance of sophistication, comfort and practicality for modern everyday living.\r\n\r\nA dedicated kitchen skylight floods the core living space with ample natural light, creating a bright, airy and inviting atmosphere for daily cooking, family dining and casual social gatherings. The seamless open-plan living and dining layout boosts indoor flow and spaciousness, while refined interior finishes add subtle everyday luxury to daily life.\r\n\r\nBoasting functional space planning, reliable build quality and timeless aesthetics, this low-maintenance residence offers long-lasting comfort and premium living appeal for many years to come.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson and Amy 022 571 7074 today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home to experience it for yourself. For more information, and find all you need please visit https://www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
